docs {
  # 04 - Customer Loyalty & Tier Profile

  Thu muc nay chua cac bai kiem thu cho Module Loyalty & Tier Profile (Task 5):
  - Tra cuu diem thuong loyalty cua thanh vien dang dang nhap (`GET /store/customers/me/loyalty-points`)
  - Tinh toan thong tin hang thanh vien tiep theo theo vung tien te (`GET /store/customers/me/next-tier?region_id=...`)
  - Kiem thu bao mat khi truy cap endpoint loyalty ma khong co Bearer token (401 Unauthorized).
}
